{"id": "ledgar/test/5812", "source": "ledgar", "primitive": "choice", "split": "test", "state": "\"EACH BORROWER SHALL INDEMNIFY AND HOLD HARMLESS THE INDEMNITEES AGAINST ANY CLAIMS THAT MAY BE INCURRED BY OR ASSERTED AGAINST ANY INDEMNITEE, INCLUDING CLAIMS ASSERTED BY ANY OBLIGOR OR OTHER PERSON OR ARISING FROM THE NEGLIGENCE OF AN INDEMNITEE. In no event shall any party to a Loan Document have any obligation thereunder to indemnify or hold harmless an Indemnitee with respect to a Claim that is determined in a final, non-appealable judgment by a court of competent jurisdiction to result from the gross negligence or willful misconduct of such Indemnitee.\"", "question": "{\"type\": \"choice\", \"instructions\": \"Which contract provision category does this clause belong to?\", \"criteria\": {\"Adjustments\": null, \"Agreements\": null, \"Amendments\": null, \"Anti-Corruption Laws\": null, \"Applicable Laws\": null, \"Approvals\": null, \"Arbitration\": null, \"Assignments\": null, \"Assigns\": null, \"Authority\": null, \"Authorizations\": null, \"Base Salary\": null, \"Benefits\": null, \"Binding Effects\": null, \"Books\": null, \"Brokers\": null, \"Capitalization\": null, \"Change In Control\": null, \"Closings\": null, \"Compliance With Laws\": null, \"Confidentiality\": null, \"Consent To Jurisdiction\": null, \"Consents\": null, \"Construction\": null, \"Cooperation\": null, \"Costs\": null, \"Counterparts\": null, \"Death\": null, \"Defined Terms\": null, \"Definitions\": null, \"Disability\": null, \"Disclosures\": null, \"Duties\": null, \"Effective Dates\": null, \"Effectiveness\": null, \"Employment\": null, \"Enforceability\": null, \"Enforcements\": null, \"Entire Agreements\": null, \"Erisa\": null, \"Existence\": null, \"Expenses\": null, \"Fees\": null, \"Financial Statements\": null, \"Forfeitures\": null, \"Further Assurances\": null, \"General\": null, \"Governing Laws\": null, \"Headings\": null, \"Indemnifications\": null, \"Indemnity\": null, 